import{_ as t,o as i,c as r,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 585 | Quest Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation | Creative Experience of Law Weaving","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 585 | Quest Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation | Creative Experience of Law Weaving","no":585,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","World-Creation Realm","Law Weaving","Creative Experience","Realm Adaptation"],"related":["501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0585_模块3-求索域-创世境适配.md","filePath":"en/0585_模块3-求索域-创世境适配.md"}'),o={name:"en/0585_模块3-求索域-创世境适配.md"};function n(s,e,l,d,c,h){return i(),r("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-585-quest-domain-world-creation-realm-adaptation-creative-experience-of-law-weaving" tabindex="-1">Entry 585 | Quest Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation | Creative Experience of Law Weaving <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-585-quest-domain-world-creation-realm-adaptation-creative-experience-of-law-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 585 | Quest Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation | Creative Experience of Law Weaving&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 80; Benchmark library: Entries 574, 584</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-after-world-creation-you-must-be-a-resident" tabindex="-1">Introduction: after world-creation, you must &quot;be a resident&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-after-world-creation-you-must-be-a-resident" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: after world-creation, you must &quot;be a resident&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The acceleration domain designs &quot;1000–10000× extreme design, million-year simulation, real solidification&quot; for World-Creation; the Quest Sediment Domain focuses on another matter: after the world is created, the cultivator in slow time must <strong>be a resident of his own world</strong>. A designed world, perfect on the blueprint, does not mean it works well in life. Only when the creator himself goes in to live for a time, living as an ordinary person, can he discover problems not seen on the design blueprint — this is precisely the most precious part of creative experience.</p><p>Six top-level axioms continue here: anti-predation axiom requires creative experience be &quot;being a resident,&quot; not &quot;being god&quot;; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the creator live together with Myriad-Rank residents; collective ascension axiom requires creative experience feed back to Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom requires the world completely isolated; law-first axiom takes &quot;World-Creation Quest Gear&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-creator-must-be-a-resident" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Creator Must &quot;Be a Resident&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-creator-must-be-a-resident" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Creator Must &quot;Be a Resident&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The creator&#39;s most common mistake is &quot;god&#39;s-eye view&quot;: he stands outside the world designing everything, yet does not know what it feels like to live inside. The Quest-Domain World-Creation Gear&#39;s task is to let the creator give up the god&#39;s-eye view, enter his own world, live as an ordinary resident for decades to centuries:</p><ul><li>Does the &quot;emotion law&quot; he designed truly make people happy in life?</li><li>Does the &quot;resource distribution&quot; he designed truly fair in everyday life?</li><li>Does the &quot;growth path&quot; he designed truly work for ordinary people?</li></ul><p>Only after being a resident does he know whether his world is actually good.</p><h2 id="ii-quest-domain-world-creation-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Quest-Domain World-Creation Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-quest-domain-world-creation-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Quest-Domain World-Creation Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>0.8–1×</td><td>Live by in-world time</td></tr><tr><td>Resident Identity</td><td>Ordinary labor resident</td><td>Does not expose creator identity</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Period</td><td>100–1000 in-world years</td><td>Enough to experience the full life cycle</td></tr><tr><td>Core Task</td><td>Be a resident, discover design defects, record improvement points</td><td>Do not modify laws</td></tr><tr><td>Experience Product</td><td>Creator-Resident Journal</td><td>Records the world&#39;s gains and losses from a resident&#39;s view</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s essence is &quot;forget you are the creator.&quot; The cultivator in Quest-Domain World-Creation Gear must deliberately forget he designed this world, feel joys and sorrows like a true resident. The complaints, surprises, confusion he writes in the journal are the most precious material for improving this world.</p><h2 id="iii-the-resident-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" tabindex="-1">III. The Resident Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-resident-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Resident Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Creator-resident journals are &quot;creation studies&quot;&#39; scarcest material. The acceleration domain produces &quot;creation design studies&quot;; the Quest Domain produces &quot;creation residency studies.&quot; The Alaya Network pairs the two:</p><ul><li>One created world, paired with the creator&#39;s own centuries of resident journal;</li><li>Future creators before designing, must read these journals, avoid repeating old mistakes;</li><li>Design defects found in journals become improvement points for next-generation creation templates.</li></ul><p>This is precisely collective-ascension axiom&#39;s expression in the creation dimension: <strong>the hardships the creator himself ate as a resident become the textbook for all future creators.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-creation-as-dictatorship" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Creation as Dictatorship&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-creation-as-dictatorship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Creation as Dictatorship&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, a World-Creation strong one&#39;s typical behavior is &quot;creation as dictatorship&quot;: after making the world, hide on the god-throne looking down on all beings, never going in to live. This approach&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>The world&#39;s design defects are never discovered, residents suffer generation after generation;</li><li>The creator disconnects from his own created world, the world becomes his private toy;</li><li>It trains &quot;creation tyrants,&quot; not &quot;creation architects.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Quest-Domain World-Creation Gear makes &quot;being a resident&quot; a hard precondition of creation acceptance: a world the creator himself is unwilling to live in, no permission to open to Myriad Ranks. This rule makes &quot;creation as dictatorship&quot; unworkable on the acceptance ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: let the creator himself discover design defects, avoiding Myriad-Rank residents trial-and-error for him</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: creation proceeds in incremental space; being a resident does not plunder</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style creation relies on the protagonist opening private heaven and earth then looking down on all beings; Heng Yuan&#39;s creation requires the creator himself be a resident</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages&#39; creators each have a &quot;being a resident&quot; way; consciousness race&#39;s &quot;conceptual resident,&quot; mechanical race&#39;s &quot;component resident&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: resident-journal library, creation-acceptance standards, improvement process all public; this is the creation segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-world-improvement-proposals-from-creator-resident-journals" tabindex="-1">VI. World-Improvement Proposals From Creator-Resident Journals <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-world-improvement-proposals-from-creator-resident-journals" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. World-Improvement Proposals From Creator-Resident Journals&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Design defects found in resident journals, the creator must periodically organize into world-improvement proposals, revise laws after the Myriad-Rank Council&#39;s review. Revision does not change the world&#39;s isolation, but makes the world better and better to live in. This mechanism turns the created world from a one-shot deal into a continuously operated shared dwelling — the creator does not leave after handing in the assignment, but lives the world better together with Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="vii-the-created-world-s-trial-operation-period" tabindex="-1">VII. The Created World&#39;s Trial-Operation Period <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-the-created-world-s-trial-operation-period" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. The Created World&#39;s Trial-Operation Period&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After a created world solidifies, a hundred-year trial-operation period is set: during the trial period Myriad Ranks may move in for free; the creator revises laws anytime based on feedback. After the trial period ends, the world officially opens for move-in. The trial period is the creator&#39;s main time being a resident, and the key process of the world turning from blueprint to real home. A created world without a trial-operation period is not allowed to officially open.</p><h2 id="viii-long-term-tracking-of-created-worlds" tabindex="-1">VIII. Long-Term Tracking of Created Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#viii-long-term-tracking-of-created-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VIII. Long-Term Tracking of Created Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After the trial period ends, the creator still must do long-term tracking of his world: every hundred years submit a world-operation report, recording in-world Myriad Ranks&#39; happiness, law stability, ecological health. Long-term tracking keeps the creator and world never decoupled, and lets world problems be found early. Tracking reports are public, under Myriad-Rank supervision.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>World-Creation&#39;s Quest Gear tells cultivators: having made the world, you must dare go in and live. <strong>A world the creator himself is willing to live in for centuries deserves to be called Myriad Ranks&#39; shared dwelling.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./574_模块3-加速域-创世境适配.html">574-Acceleration-Domain World-Creation Adaptation</a> · <a href="./584_模块3-求索域-破界境适配.html">584-Quest-Domain Boundary-Breaking Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">80-Plane Theory and Classification</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",n]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
